---
import { BUSINESS, SERVICIOS, VENTAJAS } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="barra" class="bg-secondary text-secondary-content scroll-mt-20 py-20 sm:py-24">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
			<span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">La barra</span>
			<h2 class="font-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Pescado, ensaladas y barra</h2>
			<div class="cenefa-perla mx-auto mt-5 h-1 w-32"></div>
			<p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-white/80">
				Lo que más se repite en la ficha: el pescado y las ensaladas. La carta completa y los
				precios se consultan en el bar; aquí no se publican importes sin confirmar.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			{
				SERVICIOS.map((servicio) => (
					<article class="group rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-white/[0.07] p-7 transition-colors hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-white/[0.1]">
						<span class="text-accent flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent/40">
							<i class={`${servicio.icon} text-2xl`} />
						</span>
						<h3 class="font-display mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-white">{servicio.title}</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">{servicio.text}</p>
					</article>
				))
			}
		</div>

		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-white/[0.07] p-6">
			<p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80">
				¿Mesa para comer o para cenar? Llama al bar y te lo confirman al momento. Recuerda que
				los martes cierra.
			</p>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
				<a href={BUSINESS.phoneHref} class="btn btn-accent gap-2 rounded-full">
					<i class="ri-phone-line"></i> {BUSINESS.phone}
				</a>
				<a
					href={BUSINESS.googleMaps}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="btn gap-2 rounded-full border-white/40 bg-transparent text-white hover:border-white hover:bg-white hover:text-secondary"
				>
					<i class="ri-google-fill"></i> Ficha de Google
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-16 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-6 border-t border-white/20 pt-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
			{
				VENTAJAS.map((ventaja) => (
					<div class="flex gap-3">
						<i class={`${ventaja.icon} text-accent mt-1 shrink-0 text-lg`} />
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">{ventaja.title}</h3>
							<p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/70">{ventaja.text}</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				))
			}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
